get to the point; no book report here. Saw this in a Resy as a new place to try and sent it to the foodie husband. We went for my bday weekend as a surprise and ordered mostly all the tapas. Since we are greedy we forgot some pics. But we had the Ceviche (forgot the name) it was spicy and good. We felt the tacos (shrimp and fish) was heavily bready (if it's not a word it is today). Flavor of the food was good and dranks was strong definitely adult worthy on them drinks. Will have to be back to try main courses."},{"business_id":"CZ907J8vyP0xs56ggEgsqQ","review_id":"PltZ5qek5r8dfUpJCQyGEw","date":"2021-10-16T14:36:49","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9382873773574829,"text_excerpt":"What good fortune to find this marvelous place! We were greeted and made welcome on entry to this funky , modern spot . The menu is a creative fusion of Latin inspired dishes - Peruvian, Mexican, Central & South American It would lend itself well to just choosing multiple dishes for everyone to share which is what we basically did. Peruvian ceviche and the guacamole were great dishes to start- cauliflower tacos were delicious though we had the sauce on the side- if you love HOT , go for it!!! The Caribbean Fish ( mahi on this night) was tender and flavorful, Churrasco was the stand out dish for sure - wow! Perfectly prepared steak partnered with chimichurri , Lomo Saltado served with deli..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"CZ907J8vyP0xs56ggEgsqQ","photo_id":"ZejY1irhfDmN9eGplsKeXg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ZejY1irhfDmN9eGplsKeXg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9015957117080688},{"business_id":"CZ907J8vyP0xs56ggEgsqQ","photo_id":"KNmROw5GM7MutHwD_skoJw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/KNmROw5GM7MutHwD_skoJw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8491689562797546},{"business_id":"CZ907J8vyP0xs56ggEgsqQ","photo_id":"VC0XR7KPnhABU74im0VmSA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/VC0XR7KPnhABU74im0VmSA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7716946601867676},{"business_id":"CZ907J8v